    "title": "Murphy's Law: Tom Tiffany Loves Trump - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Bruce Murphy ,\n1 days ago How loyal has Tom Tiffany been to President Donald Trump? In 2025, according to Congressional Quarterly, Tiffany supported Trump’s position on 99% of the votes taken. Some Democrats have derided Tiffany as a “puppet” of Trump, but that underplays the strength and philosophical consistency of Tiffany. According to a rating system widely used by political scientists, Tiffany is the most conservative of the state’s eight U.S. House members, and one of the most right-wing members of the House from Wisconsin in modern history. Read full article",
